With a .booping marker in the cwd the run appends exactly one [tracker {verb}] line, carrying
the receipt, to the attached vault's log.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- cmd --
booping-tracker states --team ENG
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
states ENG: cli driver, no-op
-- stderr --
-- expected/cwd/vault/.booping.log --
[..]Z: [tracker states] states ENG: cli driver, no-op
